# Shell scripts (husky hooks in particular) must stay LF -- core.autocrlf=true
# on a Windows checkout otherwise rewrites them to CRLF, and a CRLF-terminated
# command line breaks `sh -e` invocation (git-for-windows' hook runner failed
# with a garbled "env: unknown option" error until this was added), silently
# disabling the pre-commit version-bump hook on Windows.
.husky/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
